<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Reset Your Password - Nadoumi</title>
  <style><%- include('../styles/email-base.css') %></style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <div class="logo">Nadoumi</div>
      <h1>Reset Your Password</h1>
    </div>
    
    <p>We received a request to reset your password for your Nadoumi account (<strong><%= email %></strong>).</p>
    
    <p>Click the button below to reset your password:</p>
    
    <div class="button-container">
      <a href="<%= resetUrl %>" class="button">Reset Password</a>
    </div>
    
    <div class="details-box">
      <p style="margin: 0;" class="text-warning">
        <strong>⚠️ Important:</strong> This link will expire in 1 hour. If you didn't request a password reset, please ignore this email and your password will remain unchanged.
      </p>
    </div>
    
    <p>If the button doesn't work, copy and paste the following link into your browser:</p>
    
    <div class="link-fallback">
      <%= resetUrl %>
    </div>
    
    <div class="footer">
      <p>This is an automated email. Please do not reply.</p>
      <p>&copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Nadoumi. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
